{"node":{"id":"MONDO:0007646","label":"Gamstorp-Wohlfart syndrome","definition":"A rare peripheral neuropathy characterized by slowly progressive axonal, motor greater than sensory polyneuropathy combined with neuromytonia (including spontaneous muscular activity at rest (myokymia), impaired muscle relaxation (pseudomyotonia), and contractures of hands and feet) and neuromyotonic or myokymic discharges on needle EMG. It presents with distal lower limb weakness with gait impairment, muscle stiffness, fasciculations and cramps in hands and legs worsened by cold, decreased to absent tendon reflexes, intrinsic hand muscle atrophy and, variably, mild distal sensory impairment.","synonyms":["ARAN-NM","ARCMT2-NM","NMAN","autosomal recessive Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease type 2 with neuromyotonia","neuromyotonia and axonal neuropathy, autosomal recessive"],"xrefs":["DOID:0050526","GARD:0012353","MEDGEN:1814513","OMIM:137200","Orphanet:324442","SCTID:711406009","UMLS:C5700127","icd11.foundation:1738677442"],"parents":[],"parents_labels":{},"children":[],"children_labels":{},"in_core":false,"cluster_id":null,"is_group":false,"n_genes":1,"n_phenotypes":52,"mechanism_classes":[]},"genes":[{"id":"e_b9191273fc13","source":"MONDO:0007646","target":"HINT1","type":"caused_by","evidence":[{"db":"Orphanet","origin":"Orphanet","record":"ORPHA:324442","level":"curated","date":"2026-06-23","url":"https://www.orpha.net/en/disease/detail/324442","confidence":0.95,"snippet":"Disease-causing germline mutation(s) (loss of function) in (Assessed) — histidine triad nucleotide binding protein 1"},{"db":"HPO","origin":"Orphanet","record":"ORPHA:324442","level":"curated","date":"2026-09-02","confidence":0.9,"url":"https://hpo.jax.org/browse/disease/ORPHA:324442","snippet":"HINT1 is annotated as disease gene of ORPHA:324442 (HPO genes_to_phenotype, Orphanet-derived)"}],"contradicting":[],"confidence":0.95,"independent_sources":["Orphanet"],"level":"curated"}],"phenotypes":[{"edge":{"id":"e_ae6ffcf477